<title>FRANCE: FIGURE SKATING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP ICE DANCE MEDALS.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP ICE DANCE MEDALS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oksana Gritschuk and Evgeny Platov of Russia won the ice dancing gold medals at the European figure skating championships on Friday.</p>
<p>Compatriots Anjelika Krylova and Oleg Ovsiannikov took silver and Sophie Moniotte and Pascal Lavanchy of France bronze.</p>
